        "description": "Eritrea's beloved fava beans — similar to Egyptian ful but with more fresh vegetables, green chili, and a generous olive oil drizzle. Asmara's street carts serve shahan ful as the evening meal. The Italian-Eritrean colonial fusion (olive oil and espresso alongside ful) has made Asmara's food scene a viral discovery.",
